        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "6. In order to return from leave, the unit member shall submit a request in writing to the associate superintendent of personnel services at least one (1) month before the date the employee desires to be reassigned. If a unit member is offered an assignment for which the unit member is qualified at the same pay grade and the assignment is refused, the unit member will have to resign or be terminated.",
