                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "C. Notwithstanding the above, the Board may implement modified work weeks for safety and security personnel, not to exceed forty (40) regularly scheduled hours in a six (6) day week (Saturday, 12:01 a.m. to Friday, 12:00 p.m.). Time worked in excess of forty (40) hours in a modified work week shall be overtime and paid at one and one half (1½) the unit member's regular rate of pay.",
